References

The wave-string alphabet, lane semantics, and default bus palette originate in
WaveDrom by Aliaksei Chapyzhenka (Copyright 2011-2026), which is MIT licensed:

  https://wavedrom.com/
  https://github.com/wavedrom/wavedrom

SVG elliptical-arc endpoint-to-center conversion follows the SVG 2
implementation notes:

  https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG2/implnote.html#ArcImplementationNotes

The Rust sources in this repository are a separate implementation. Those
references describe the wave language and arc geometry this renderer follows.
